    "detailed_description": "Explore your way through mystical islands while learning about your characters past. In this short adventure game you play as the protagonist of a memoire, telling a story from the pacific in the late 1800 century.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game requires roomscale interactions and a play area of at least 2x2 m. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFinishing the game takes around 30 minutes to 2 hours depending on how you play.<br />\r\nWe recommend taking your time, playing the game without stress in a calm environment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe hope you like it!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbout us:<br />\r\nThe Snigelsoft team contains of three friends Jonas, Daniel and John. We have done the game as a side project on our spare time. Our hope is to have time to continue making the game, finishing all the parts, and with your help maybe even do it more professionally :-)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures include:<br />\r\nVoice acted story, Immersive environment, Beautiful soundtrack by film score composer",
